  "ID": "43237",
  "post_title": "El Tossalet prende la primera de las tres hogueras de San Antonio en Onda",
  "post_date": "2014-01-12 14:30:55",
  "post_name": "el-tossalet-prende-la-primera-de-las-tres-hogueras-de-san-antonio-en-onda-2",
  "autor": "redaccion",
  "imagen_destacada_id": "NULL",
  "categorias": "Fiestas|Noticias",
  "post_content": "<p>El barrio del Tossalet ha prendido la primera hoguera de las tres que se encender&aacute;n en una semana en Onda para festejar a San Antonio. La reina de la Fira 2013, Mary Pradas &Aacute;lvaro, ha dado fuego a la traca con la que se encend&iacute;a la monumental hoguera situada junto al parque deportivo.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/01/IMG_7555.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>La acompa&ntilde;aban el alcalde, Salvador Aguilella Ramos, y una amplia representaci&oacute;n de la Corporaci&oacute;n Municipal. en un segundo plano estaban la reina infantil, Claudia Ramos Gil, sus damitas y acompa&ntilde;antes. Juan L&oacute;pez Pe&ntilde;a, presidente de la Asociaci&oacute;n de Vecinos del Tossalet, organizadora de las fiestas, ha obsequiado a la reina dela Fira con un regalo.</p>\n<p>Despu&eacute;s, mujeres del barrio ha repartido bu&ntilde;uelos y pastas en forma de rosa, adem&aacute;s de moscatel, mientras la hoguera calentaba intensamente y sonaba la m&uacute;sica en la pista deportiva.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/foguerasantantonitossalet14/img_7539.jpg\" alt=\"img_7539\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/foguerasantantonitossalet14/img_7540.jpg\" alt=\"img_7540\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/foguerasantantonitossalet14/img_7542.jpg\" alt=\"img_7542\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/foguerasantantonitossalet14/img_7544.jpg\" alt=\"img_7544\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/foguerasantantonitossalet14/img_7545.jpg\" alt=\"img_7545\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/foguerasantantonitossalet14/img_7546.jpg\" alt=\"img_7546\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/foguerasantantonitossalet14/img_7547.jpg\" alt=\"img_7547\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/foguerasantantonitossalet14/img_7548.jpg\" alt=\"img_7548\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/foguerasantantonitossalet14/img_7549.jpg\" alt=\"img_7549\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/foguerasantantonitossalet14/img_7550.jpg\" alt=\"img_7550\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/foguerasantantonitossalet14/img_7551.jpg\" alt=\"img_7551\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/foguerasantantonitossalet14/img_7552.jpg\" alt=\"img_7552\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/foguerasantantonitossalet14/img_7553.jpg\" alt=\"img_7553\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/foguerasantantonitossalet14/img_7554.jpg\" alt=\"img_7554\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/foguerasantantonitossalet14/img_7555.jpg\" alt=\"img_7555\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/foguerasantantonitossalet14/img_7556.jpg\" alt=\"img_7556\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/foguerasantantonitossalet14/img_7557.jpg\" alt=\"img_7557\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a9